394 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The publication is printed entirely in black and white\054 so the circle itself carries the visual weight\056 The type stays small and restrained throughout\054 which lets the shapes lead and keeps the images from competing with the text\056 The two colors also map onto the book\031s two halves\054 in the spirit of yin and yang\072 white holds the functional circles and black holds the symbolic ones\056 They are opposites\054 but each half is incomplete without the other\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 395 0 R
     /Pg 376 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

