398 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The book is an accordion fold\054 a format chosen because it has no fixed beginning or end\056 Each category sits on its own side of one continuous strip\054 so the reader can flip through it endlessly\054 the way a circle can be traced without ever finishing\056 Opened up\054 it shows the split between function and meaning\056 Folded closed\054 it brings the two back together into a single loop\054 and the book becomes the shape it studies\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 399 0 R
     /Pg 376 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

